              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MsGigi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I halved this recipe, substituted the raspberries for blackberries and the mango and pomegranate juices for fresh squeezed orange juice. It turned out simply amazing! Make sure all the ingredients are super cold, if not frozen, to make this treat super great!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ChristineM"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this was delicious and refreshing! To make it a bit frostier and thicker, I used frozen blueberries and one fresh mango instead of the mango juice, used nonfat yogurt instead of the milk, then thinned to desired consistency with a little soy milk. Nice smoothie recipe to add to the collection! Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2009-06-28T06:47:42.533Z"
          },
          {
