              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "zionlion"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great idea for breakfast. Been making this smoothie for a while, making variations on the recipe to change up the taste a little. Variety is the spice of life. As far as substitutions, this recipe is also good with frozen whole berries; saves on prep time. Also great with orange juice as substitution for the mango juice. Thanks for the idea.",
            "datePublished": "2012-04-29T11:51:36.030Z"
          },
          {
