            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pickycook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I tried this without strawberries and used pomegranate-blueberry and peach-mango juice. I could easily finish the 2 servings myself, however it was not the thickness I'm used to, may add some ice or a frozen banana next time. Also had to constantly stir it because of separation.",
